{
  "name": "dsh-persona-select",
  "version": "0.4.0-rc4",
  "private": false,
  "description": "DSH注入系统提示词和设置注入上下文功能插件，插件内置鲸鱼娘社区人设！本文中和插件设置界面都将注入系统提示词的行为称作“人设正文”，将设置注入上下文的行为称作“历史对话”。可通过在设置界面人设管理保存为预设“人设”，并且支持将保存的人设正文和历史对话作为数据块选择PNG图片或作为JSON文件导出，用PNG图片本身作为封面。注入的系统提示词可以自行编辑注入位置。支持屏蔽dsh本身注入的系统提示词、runtime上下文、schema工具以及其他user侧内容，使得发送内容保证让模型仅接收对话内容，且拥有工具保活通道，避免后续调用工具仅输出文本。历史对话可通过DSH本身导出(/export)的Session日志直接导入，用仿照DSH本身注入标签的格式包裹。各会话单独保存设置和人设，人设切换和设置勾选项不影响新会话和进行中的会话。",
  "license": "MIT",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "index.js",
  "icon": "./icon.png",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./core": "./lib/core/index.js",
    "./core/owner": "./lib/core/owner.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "lib",
    "icon.png",
    "locale",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh": ">=0.1.7-rc.2 <1.0.0",
    "dsh-persona-select-picker": "0.4.0-rc4",
    "dsh-persona-select-settings": "0.4.0-rc4"
  },
  "peerDependenciesMeta": {
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh": {
      "optional": true
    },
    "dsh-persona-select-picker": {
      "optional": true
    },
    "dsh-persona-select-settings": {
      "optional": true
    }
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=18"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/gosutry/dsh-persona-select.git",
    "directory": "packages/dsh-persona-select"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/gosutry/dsh-persona-select#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/gosutry/dsh-persona-select/issues"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "persona",
    "system-prompt",
    "deepseek-harness"
  ]
}
